the computer.  An extended keyboard is attached to the  computer.
On (some) machines with dirty ROM, the ROM indicates the presence
of  a  keyboard or mouse.  When this nonexistent device is probed
for, the result is an infinite loop.   This  is  believed  to  be
triggered  by  the  driver probing for extended mice, and non‐EMP
Logitech mice.
